{"3600440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lillapad", "steam_appid": 3600440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Lillapad</i>, you play as Lilla, a young girl cursed into a tadpole by the mysterious King Frog. But when she discovers she can shift between tadpole and frog forms by hopping onto lilypads, a magical adventure begins.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a magical pond hidden in her backyard, solve puzzles using your dual forms, and search for two missing petals needed to restore the Golden Lilypad, the most powerful lilypad in the pond, and break the curse to become human again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The magic of Lilypads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lilypads aren’t just decoration, they let you swap between frog and tadpole anytime. Each form has its own strengths, so you’ll need to use both to make it through the pond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/5376f62ab3b22a8b5b6ee346a8077388.poster.avif?t=1769035355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/5376f62ab3b22a8b5b6ee346a8077388.webm?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/5376f62ab3b22a8b5b6ee346a8077388.mp4?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As a tadpole...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim through the deepest parts of the pond, squeeze into hidden spots, and move lilypads into place to shape your own path. You may be small, but that has its advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/d65809924363eb0817067d604f3ac73b.poster.avif?t=1769035355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/d65809924363eb0817067d604f3ac73b.webm?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/d65809924363eb0817067d604f3ac73b.mp4?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As a frog... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb over rocks, break weak walls, and swing across gaps using your tongue. You can even swallow seeds to spit them out to solve puzzles. On land, your frog skills truly shine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/727cf1ba3ad5f15bf188e85b49028ad4.poster.avif?t=1769035355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/727cf1ba3ad5f15bf188e85b49028ad4.webm?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/727cf1ba3ad5f15bf188e85b49028ad4.mp4?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Ruggero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruggero is a mysterious Italian frog who helps you uncover your transformation abilities. He’s your guide through the pond and the key to understanding your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/b09c169b451e9a680c1023f499cb72bc.poster.avif?t=1769035355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/b09c169b451e9a680c1023f499cb72bc.webm?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/b09c169b451e9a680c1023f499cb72bc.mp4?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Missing petals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Golden Lilypad is the only thing powerful enough to break your curse—but it’s missing two petals. You’ll need to use all your frog and tadpole tricks to find them, solve environmental puzzles, and get your human self back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/6e9c3cfa96ad26f186d77b58609a447b.poster.avif?t=1769035355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/6e9c3cfa96ad26f186d77b58609a447b.webm?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/6e9c3cfa96ad26f186d77b58609a447b.mp4?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Lillapad</i>, you play as Lilla, a young girl cursed into a tadpole by the mysterious King Frog. But when she discovers she can shift between tadpole and frog forms by hopping onto lilypads, a magical adventure begins.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a magical pond hidden in her backyard, solve puzzles using your dual forms, and search for two missing petals needed to restore the Golden Lilypad, the most powerful lilypad in the pond, and break the curse to become human again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The magic of Lilypads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lilypads aren’t just decoration, they let you swap between frog and tadpole anytime. Each form has its own strengths, so you’ll need to use both to make it through the pond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/5376f62ab3b22a8b5b6ee346a8077388.poster.avif?t=1769035355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/5376f62ab3b22a8b5b6ee346a8077388.webm?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/5376f62ab3b22a8b5b6ee346a8077388.mp4?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As a tadpole...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim through the deepest parts of the pond, squeeze into hidden spots, and move lilypads into place to shape your own path. You may be small, but that has its advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/d65809924363eb0817067d604f3ac73b.poster.avif?t=1769035355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/d65809924363eb0817067d604f3ac73b.webm?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/d65809924363eb0817067d604f3ac73b.mp4?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As a frog... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb over rocks, break weak walls, and swing across gaps using your tongue. You can even swallow seeds to spit them out to solve puzzles. On land, your frog skills truly shine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/727cf1ba3ad5f15bf188e85b49028ad4.poster.avif?t=1769035355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/727cf1ba3ad5f15bf188e85b49028ad4.webm?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/727cf1ba3ad5f15bf188e85b49028ad4.mp4?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Ruggero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruggero is a mysterious Italian frog who helps you uncover your transformation abilities. He’s your guide through the pond and the key to understanding your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/b09c169b451e9a680c1023f499cb72bc.poster.avif?t=1769035355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/b09c169b451e9a680c1023f499cb72bc.webm?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/b09c169b451e9a680c1023f499cb72bc.mp4?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Missing petals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Golden Lilypad is the only thing powerful enough to break your curse—but it’s missing two petals. You’ll need to use all your frog and tadpole tricks to find them, solve environmental puzzles, and get your human self back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/6e9c3cfa96ad26f186d77b58609a447b.poster.avif?t=1769035355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/6e9c3cfa96ad26f186d77b58609a447b.webm?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/extras/6e9c3cfa96ad26f186d77b58609a447b.mp4?t=1769035355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Cursed into a tadpole, you’ll swap between frog and tadpole forms in this puzzle-platformer to explore a magical pond, solve puzzles, and become human again", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/06f8203527e01fd21df1007cbb942df0568a5795/header.jpg?t=1769035355", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/e207ed0175e270e907d996717ee5ec7a6819e6e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769035355", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600440/e207ed0175e270e907d996717ee5ec7a6819e6e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769035355", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> WIndows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Quad-Core, 2.7 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 960 / r9 380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 650 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> WIndows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (6 GB) / AMD RX 580 (8 GB) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": []